@ThucTap.Server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5125

### List products
GET {{ThucTap.Server_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Search products
GET {{ThucTap.Server_HostAddress}}/api/products?search=gia%20dung
Accept: application/json

### Get product details, including reviews
GET {{ThucTap.Server_HostAddress}}/api/products/coffee-dripper
Accept: application/json

### Unknown product returns 404
GET {{ThucTap.Server_HostAddress}}/api/products/not-found
Accept: application/json

